&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Achieve pipeline coverage of 3–4x quota across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain a forecast accuracy of &amp;gt;85%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
