&lt;li&gt;Size: 6-8 Enterprise Account Executives Quota Responsibility: $15-20M annual recurring revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel: Up to&amp;nbsp;50% within territory and to customer/company meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
