&lt;li&gt;Programming language including Java, Go, Python, Ruby, TypeScript, or JavaScript;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and consuming REST or gRPC APIs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with databases including PostgreSQL, mySQL, or NoSQL systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud environments including AWS, or GCP;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend frameworks including React, Vue or building product UIs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning large components or projects and driving alignment with cross-functional partners; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debugging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $206,086 - $285,600/yr&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary range represents the base salary range for the role and any sales commissions/sales bonuses targets, if applicable, would be in addition to the base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;40 hrs/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;50% Telecommuting Permitted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple Positions Available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits for this role may include: equity, company bonus or sales commissions/bonuses; 401(k) plan; medical, dental, and vision benefits; and wellness stipends. &lt;strong&gt;WA49&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
