&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and acquired knowledge to drive strategic decisions at an engineering leadership level;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create widely circulated plans, driving consistency, clarity and building alignment across teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalize and execute critical cross functional programs spanning multiple engineering organizations for Infrastructure (Developer Infrastructure, Core Infrastructure, Service Infrastructure);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape technical design, predicting technical roadblocks by collaborating with engineers, and identify trade-offs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive programs that span across Stripe in the core infrastructure of Stripe’s payment systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the successful definition, cross-functional strategy, planning and execution of large-scale technical programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex problems and enable products and infrastructure at scale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver exceptional results through building and implementing solutions that scale while protecting our users and serving the business; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate deep technical expertise in software infrastructure (e.g. AWS Cloud Infrastructure, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud, Oracle Cloud, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
